<title>FRANCE: GOLF-FRENCH OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FRENCH OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round scores at the</p>
<p>rain-interrupted French Open golf tournament on Friday:</p>
<p>64 Retief Goosen (South Africa)</p>
<p>66 Colin Montgomerie (Scotland)</p>
<p>67 Massimo Florioli (Italy), Marc Farry (France), Lee</p>
<p>Westwood (Britain0, Steve Webster (Britain)</p>
<p>68 Jarmo Sandelin (Sweden), Martin Gates (Britain),</p>
<p>John Wade (Australia), Anders Forsbrand (Sweden),</p>
<p>Eduardo Romero (Argentina), Sandy Lyle (Britain),</p>
<p>Jose Coceres (Argentina), Peter Lonard (Australia),</p>
<p>Adam Hunter (Britain), Antoine Lebouc (France),</p>
<p>Brian Davis (Britain), Santiago Luna (Chile), Jamie</p>
<p>Spence (Britain), Stuart Cage (Britain)</p>
<p>69 Michael Jonzon (Sweden), Roger Chapman (Britain),</p>
<p>Diego Borrego (Spain), Niclas Joakimides (France),</p>
<p>Jim Payne (Britain).</p>
